'''Li'l Mohawk Cat''' (ちびネコモヒカン ''Chibi Neko Mohikan'', '''Chibi Mohawk Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy first found in [[Tiny Meows (Deadly)|Li'l Cat Awakes!]]. It was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Li'l Mohawk Cat
|image = E 322.png
|appearance = [[Tiny Meows (Deadly)|Li'l Cat Awakes!]]
[[Path to +45|Li'l Cat's Trial]]
|money drop = 1,980¢ - 7,821¢
}}

==Enemy==
Don't let its cuteness fool you; this unit has enormous health and damage, along with a very fast attack rate that can easily wreck your defense line. It has less health than [[Manic Mohawk Cat (Enemy)|Manic Mohawk Cat]]. However, he has more health than its [[Crazed Cat (Enemy)|crazed]] counterpart, and it also serves as a meatshield for [[Professor A.]] and [[Teacher Bear]], making it even more deadly.

